### Poll pending commands using the default page size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/firmware/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}

### Poll the next page using nextCursor from the previous response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/firmware/devices/{{deviceId}}/commands?limit=25&cursor=replace-with-next-cursor
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceToken}}
